    {
      "text": "CTCAC CA-26-410: Rotary Gardens, located at 500 Linden Avenue in South San Francisco on a 0.49 acre site, requested $3,651,611 in annual federal tax credits but is being recommended for $3,385,453 in annual federal tax credits and $20,562,128 of tax-exempt bond cap to finance the new construction of 80 units of housing, consisting of 79 restricted rental units and 1 unrestricted manager's unit. Recorded as a note because this funding covers Rotary Gardens (80 units), which may be one component of this record.",
